{"title":"2019 AIME I Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Pattern)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Pattern)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Official_MAA)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Official MAA)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_#1(Using_Smart_Manipulation)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution #1(Using Smart Manipulation)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_6_by_Steakmath_(fast_and_simple)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 6 by Steakmath (fast and simple)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/2511ced2d0525f01babe6c1df6bc04741aeae61c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N = 9 + 99 + 999 + 9999 + \\cdots + \\underbrace{99\\ldots 99}_\\text{321 digits}.\\]\" width=\"334\" height=\"37\" />Find the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's express the number in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/b/02bedd46306390e4c9b9293a00c7de6620b71b9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />. We can obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/731c9ca103b784fb2311e097b84f1b0b1ac89dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(10-1)+(10^2-1)+(10^3-1)+\\cdots+(10^{321}-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"19\" />. By the commutative and associative property, we can group it into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/9/869b85152a42b1318a1510c7b632ac013d94b1cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(10+10^2+10^3+\\cdots+10^{321})-321$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"281\" height=\"19\" />. We know the former will yield <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/7/ac7413a564d68b6f152298f6e6a6417a06114811.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1111....10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"77\" height=\"14\" />, so we only have to figure out what the last few digits are. There are currently <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9691986bc20f256cdd5f2a7c316ddaa8db873e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$321$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> 1's. We know the last four digits are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/586f09229b767e5a671847d4894e7cdfb97140d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />, and that the others will not be affected if we subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9691986bc20f256cdd5f2a7c316ddaa8db873e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$321$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />. If we do so, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e10ce724df29a726b383c49059ffc910b17d4ef2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1110-321=789$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"136\" height=\"13\" />. This method will remove three <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />'s, and add a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, the sum of the digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/5/ec55fcb10d3f79b68b44d3f893560ffbe8d9c13c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(321-3)+7+8+9=\\boxed{342}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"230\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>-eric2020\n-another Eric in 2020\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>A similar and simpler way to consider the initial manipulations is to observe that adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to each term results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/9/1a9a19163a176f359643d8d44500279cd992f03c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(10+100+... 10^{320}+10^{321})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"217\" height=\"19\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9691986bc20f256cdd5f2a7c316ddaa8db873e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$321$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> terms, so it becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/d/f6dce617fb63b1720e9491061ff3c95735f0656c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11...0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />, where there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/0/4104d093e8cb91695fd6787ce75397863b30c0e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$322$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> digits in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/d/f6dce617fb63b1720e9491061ff3c95735f0656c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11...0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />. Then, subtract the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9691986bc20f256cdd5f2a7c316ddaa8db873e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$321$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> you initially added. \n</p><p>~ BJHHar\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cb50abe2834579eb964efea4e06f96ce6978ebb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9=9$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/0/9f08090f5df2e1ea6bfb82c409ab9ec92f107c81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+99=108$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"100\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/3/67341736fe7a32c0ab583a648e699402bde0b8da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+99+999=1107$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"159\" height=\"14\" />, all the way to ten nines when we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad114c55b7154f237e2c0256d3c755361d480f46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11111111100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"14\" />. Then, when we add more nines, we repeat the same process, and quickly get that the sum of digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/f/26fd7f4479b69222611ab026dee877d9337ac8cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{342}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" /> since we have to add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/b/1bbccf0b8aaeafc903b1c6277b255ebb5b63afa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9\\lfloor \\log 321 \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"19\" /> to the sum of digits, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/9/bb99597490685bc966fe613048ec235357992fb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9\\lceil \\frac{321}9 \\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Pattern.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Pattern)\">Solution 3 (Pattern)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Pattern)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Observe how adding results in the last term but with a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> concatenated in front and also a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> subtracted (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/3/9e38a5221ea57ef451ec5652c349276be47fd6ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$09$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/5/a75cef16b301d38a271625130c1aac46a7e9ce72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$108$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd80567304f1337dadbdc4eb260b87a3143b599.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1107$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/4/bb40780ac0fe2de310465d5f254d6d873b7a594a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11106$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />). Then for any index of terms, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/5/745251e3cbdce9c4a7cc135b45f83fa584079752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11...10-n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"84\" height=\"13\" />, where the first term is of length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e3efd9b14723a92c2ae891fe27780d5f8e2b215.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />. Here, that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/f/26fd7f4479b69222611ab026dee877d9337ac8cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{342}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~BJHHar\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Official_MAA.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Official_MAA)\">Solution 4 (Official MAA)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Official MAA)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/d/24d4d55944bbfe24293983265300aa107847d3f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}N &amp;=(10-1)+(10^2-1)+\\cdots+(10^{321}-1)\\\\ &amp;=10+10^2+10^3+10^4+10^5+10^6+\\cdots 10^{321}-321 \\\\ &amp;=1110-321+10^4+10^5+10^6+\\cdots+10^{321}\\\\ &amp;=789+10^4+10^5+10^6+\\cdots+10^{321}\\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"431\" height=\"99\" />\nThe sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is therefore equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c44ceb644d11b2d2ad735064ba422d76d6c6b501.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7+8+9+(321-3)=342$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"217\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.231.28Using_Smart_Manipulation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_#1(Using_Smart_Manipulation)\">Video Solution #1(Using Smart Manipulation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution #1(Using Smart Manipulation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/JQdad7APQG8?t=22\">https://youtu.be/JQdad7APQG8?t=22</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JFHjpxoYLDk\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JFHjpxoYLDk</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TSKcjht8Rfk\">https://youtu.be/TSKcjht8Rfk</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9X18wCiYw9M\">https://youtu.be/9X18wCiYw9M</a>\n</p><p>~Shreyas S\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5\">Video Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/hzbzEAo9ezA\">https://youtu.be/hzbzEAo9ezA</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_6_by_Steakmath_.28fast_and_simple.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_6_by_Steakmath_(fast_and_simple)\">Video Solution 6 by Steakmath (fast and simple)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 6 by Steakmath (fast and simple)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/XNGRjxpPw6I\">https://youtu.be/XNGRjxpPw6I</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_I\" title=\"2019 AIME I\">2019 AIME I</a></b> 